catalog: Panel
target: file-manager panel
summary: The file-manager panel type

!! Commands

* ``file-manager:activate`` — File manager: open directory / confirm file
* ``file-manager:copy`` — File manager: copy the selected entry to the clipboard
* ``file-manager:cut`` — File manager: cut the selected entry to the clipboard
* ``file-manager:delete`` — File manager: delete the selected entry (trash when a repo is active)
* ``file-manager:duplicate`` — File manager: duplicate the selected entry
* ``file-manager:new`` — File manager: create a new folder or empty file
* ``file-manager:parent`` — File manager: go up one level
* ``file-manager:paste`` — File manager: paste the clipboard into the current directory
* ``file-manager:record`` — File manager: record the selected path — its metarecord, mf_watch = false
* ``file-manager:rename`` — File manager: rename the selected entry
* ``file-manager:root`` — File manager: jump to the root (the repo root, or / with no repo)
* ``file-manager:select`` — File manager: change the checked multi-selection (toggle / all / none)
* ``file-manager:toggle`` — File manager: toggle a view flag (root constraint / hidden dot-entries / sort by watch activity / sort by operations written)

!! Generic commands

Provides ``refresh``, ``index``, ``count``, ``select``, ``entries``, ``enter`` to [[Generic panel commands]].
